Description = "A customized version of the M249. It features a suppressor and modified internals to withstand higher back-pressure from the suppressor. The 200-round box magazine has been loaded with tungsten carbide-tipped armor-piercing ammunition. Although the cartridge offers excellent penetrability through targets, it causes increased heat and wear on the barrel and suppressor."
